    {
      "id": "s_rect_a7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 16784,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "c = neutral-axis depth below the compression face; p = fibre coordinate from the centroid,",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_a8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 16814,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "positive towards the compression face; H = section depth in that direction; dt = depth of the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_a9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 16844,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "extreme bar. The strain plane pivots about A (bar at −εud), B (face at εcu2) or C (εc2 at",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_aa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 16874,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "(1 − εc2/εcu2)·H), whichever governs for the depth c (EC2 Fig. 6.1). Compression positive.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_ab",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 17004,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Strain at fibre p",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_ac",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 16904,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\varepsilon\\left(c,p,H,d_{t}\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ c<\\frac{\\varepsilon_{cu2}d_{t}}{\\varepsilon_{cu2}+\\varepsilon_{ud}}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{ud}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{d_{t}-c}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\ \\mathrm{if}\\ c\\le H\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{cu2}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{c}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\varepsilon_{c2}\\frac{c-\\frac{H}{2}+p}{c-\\left(1-\\frac{\\varepsilon_{c2}}{\\varepsilon_{cu2}}\\right)H}\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_ad",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 17201,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Concrete stress, parabola-rectangle (EC2 3.17), no tension",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_ae",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 17144,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{c}\\left(\\varepsilon\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ \\varepsilon\\le0\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle 0\\,\\mathrm{MPa}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\ \\mathrm{if}\\ \\varepsilon<\\varepsilon_{c2}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle f_{cd}\\left(1-\\left(1-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_{c2}}\\right)^2\\right)\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle f_{cd}\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_af",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 17695,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Steel stress, elastic-plastic within ±fyd",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_ag",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 17645,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "\\sigma_{s}\\left(\\varepsilon\\right)\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ E_{s}\\varepsilon<-f_{yd}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle -f_{yd}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\ \\mathrm{if}\\ E_{s}\\varepsilon>f_{yd}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle f_{yd}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle E_{s}\\varepsilon\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": -1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
