      "x": 80,
      "y": 18455,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "For each depth c = u·H(β) the moment direction ψ is found for every β of the sweep; the point",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_b3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 18485,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "with ψ = θM (interpolated between the β steps) is the point of the P–Mθ curve.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_rect_b4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 18541,
      "props": {
        "w": 310,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "At c = u·H(β): N, M and direction ψ",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
